  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Conventional magic can only hold your attention for so long. Instead,
    you've devoted yourself to understanding truly esoteric spells, which invariably
    draws you to explore the world and all its eldritch traditions. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in either the Arcana skill or Occult skill, as well as the Library
    Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Recognize Spell]
    skill feat.
